WEBVTT

00:04.700 --> 00:09.140
The main branch wants to finish things up as soon as possible.

00:10.370 --> 00:15.810
But Monado has become strangely cautious since she met Sibyl.

00:16.540 --> 00:19.180
Monado is still just a child.

00:19.180 --> 00:23.050
We have orders to act when she wavers,

00:23.050 --> 00:26.320
but I'm under house arrest, so there's nothing I can do.

00:27.120 --> 00:29.490
Then I'll go.

00:29.490 --> 00:33.630
Acquiring the Artifact and gaining power is Monado's wish.

00:33.630 --> 00:36.150
No. It's the will of Logos.

00:39.030 --> 00:42.170
Then I'll do what I can.

00:42.170 --> 00:45.970
I may be able to take care of some obstacles.

01:12.330 --> 01:13.670
Mahiro!

01:13.670 --> 01:14.670
Hurry!

01:14.370 --> 01:15.360
Yes!

02:50.170 --> 02:53.430
The

02:50.170 --> 02:53.430
Rumbling

02:50.170 --> 02:53.430
of the

02:50.170 --> 02:53.430
Earth

02:54.500 --> 02:57.100
When did there get to be so many?

02:58.710 --> 03:00.840
It's because the seal was broken.

03:00.840 --> 03:03.310
Most of the gods have lost their sanity,

03:03.310 --> 03:05.050
and lost their will to darkness.

03:05.050 --> 03:05.880
Damn it...

03:09.150 --> 03:10.170
A mountain god.

03:10.890 --> 03:13.020
The guardians...

03:13.020 --> 03:18.890
So you're responsible for provoking me and waking me from my slumber.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.790
Of course not!

03:21.360 --> 03:22.130
Takuma!

03:24.530 --> 03:25.560
Stop!

03:27.840 --> 03:29.670
Return to your world!

03:37.050 --> 03:39.580
Be careful, Takuma.
There's no end to them.

03:39.580 --> 03:41.070
I know.

03:43.720 --> 03:46.390
It happened once a thousand years ago.

03:46.390 --> 03:52.030
The gods lost their sanity, became enraged, and I awoke.

03:52.030 --> 03:55.050
This is the haunted forest!

04:01.200 --> 04:04.070
Wait! Be calm, mountain god!

04:04.070 --> 04:05.140
I begging you.

04:05.140 --> 04:06.940
You're the ruler of this mountain.

04:06.940 --> 04:09.670
Don't get upset and caught up in this.

04:13.580 --> 04:15.570
You're strong!

04:16.880 --> 04:19.410
<i>I think you're strong!</i>

04:40.940 --> 04:44.780
I've known your family for a long time.

04:44.780 --> 04:46.940
Let me give you a warning.

04:48.220 --> 04:54.120
Destruction greater than this forest has ever known is approaching.

04:54.120 --> 04:55.280
I bet.

04:55.890 --> 04:59.830
But we can't afford to allow it,

04:59.830 --> 05:01.890
or run away from it either.

05:20.580 --> 05:23.420
<i>I know too little.</i>

05:24.190 --> 05:26.920
<i>Maybe, if I had known more,</i>

05:26.920 --> 05:31.760
<i>no one would've gotten hurt as they did.</i>

05:33.660 --> 05:34.930
<i>In the end,</i>

05:34.930 --> 05:37.630
<i>I couldn't meet with my grandmother again.</i>

05:50.910 --> 05:54.210
I guess the store house won't respond again.

05:56.780 --> 05:58.250
Yeah, I'll do my best.

05:58.650 --> 06:01.120
There's no point in sulking.

06:01.520 --> 06:03.460
I'll do what I can now.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.470
Lady Tamaki?

06:22.580 --> 06:24.250
Oh, Mitsuru.

06:24.250 --> 06:26.310
Is it morning already?

06:26.310 --> 06:27.580
Good morning.

06:28.180 --> 06:29.510
Good morning.

06:29.880 --> 06:33.010
Did you stay up all night?

06:33.520 --> 06:34.390
Yup.

06:37.390 --> 06:41.630
I'm fine. Despite how I look,
I've actually got a lot of stamina.

06:42.460 --> 06:44.960
I'd better get to school.

06:45.930 --> 06:47.400
Lady Tamaki!

06:48.440 --> 06:50.370
I'm fine, I'm fine.

06:50.370 --> 06:53.400
Despite how I look,
I actually have a hard head.

07:03.320 --> 07:05.010
So tired...

07:08.390 --> 07:09.260
Good-

07:08.660 --> 07:10.190
Tamaki, good morning!

07:10.790 --> 07:11.890
Oh, good morning.

07:11.890 --> 07:13.960
What's wrong? Not sleeping?

07:13.960 --> 07:16.230
What's up? A maiden's distress?

07:16.800 --> 07:19.070
Oh no, no.

07:19.070 --> 07:20.660
Really?

07:21.300 --> 07:22.470
If there is something,

07:22.470 --> 07:26.440
I'll lend you my straw figures and love potions, just for you!

07:26.440 --> 07:28.240
Just let me know.

07:35.620 --> 07:37.980
They're not here.

07:47.630 --> 07:49.060
Oh, Shinji!

07:49.300 --> 07:50.260
What?

07:50.260 --> 07:52.060
Tamaki, you're alone?

07:52.730 --> 07:53.700
Yes.

07:53.700 --> 07:56.140
What happened to everyone?

07:57.440 --> 07:58.740
I wonder...

08:05.710 --> 08:07.440
Mahiro, want some?

08:08.720 --> 08:11.210
I'm fine. I'm not hungry.

08:12.190 --> 08:13.050
Is that right?

08:14.790 --> 08:17.780
Yuichi, why don't you go to the roof?

08:18.460 --> 08:20.020
Tamaki will worry.

08:20.860 --> 08:22.330
Because you're not going.

08:28.700 --> 08:31.070
I'm not much of a man!

08:36.210 --> 08:39.540
Idiot, that's where you're supposed to disagree.

08:42.450 --> 08:44.450
Did something happen with Tamaki?

08:44.450 --> 08:45.940
Not really.

08:46.950 --> 08:50.860
Just that she knows how to hit me right where it hurts.

08:51.490 --> 08:53.220
Never fails.

08:53.830 --> 08:55.260
Without even meaning to.

08:59.500 --> 09:00.470
True.

09:03.470 --> 09:05.740
I'm small! So small!

09:06.210 --> 09:08.470
I want to get bigger!

09:09.410 --> 09:10.400
Want some?

09:13.880 --> 09:14.810
Thanks.

09:17.220 --> 09:21.210
Delicious! This milk is delicious.

09:27.160 --> 09:30.330
Now then... I'd better go home and do more research.

09:37.840 --> 09:39.310
Tamaki.

09:40.910 --> 09:42.810
I'm on duty. I'll walk you.

09:46.910 --> 09:48.450
Is it coming from here?

09:48.450 --> 09:50.820
Yes, there's definitely something.

09:50.820 --> 09:52.410
It's faint, but I sense it.

10:00.660 --> 10:03.720
You have great sensitivity, Sibyl.

10:04.570 --> 10:05.400
Drei!

10:05.400 --> 10:06.270
Tamaki.

10:06.270 --> 10:09.740
I wanted to contact only you,

10:09.740 --> 10:14.200
but it looks like your friends would follow you anywhere.

10:14.480 --> 10:19.380
Young friendship is such a beautiful, shining thing.

10:19.380 --> 10:21.820
You like to talk, don't you, magician?

10:21.820 --> 10:24.310
Did you come just to have a nice conversation?

10:24.690 --> 10:27.720
As you age, your conversations get longer.

10:27.720 --> 10:30.790
Sibyl, when you're around,
Monado wavers,

10:30.790 --> 10:32.760
so I want you to disappear!

10:33.360 --> 10:35.590
I won't let you place a hand on Tamaki.

10:35.830 --> 10:38.100
Senpai will protect us!

10:38.100 --> 10:42.260
I'll grant you all eternal slumber!

10:46.310 --> 10:48.280
Interrupt! Interrupt, interrupt, interrupt!

10:49.980 --> 10:52.500
Flames, burn him!

11:10.300 --> 11:11.820
This is the end!

11:12.670 --> 11:14.330
Threefold ring! Appear!

11:18.040 --> 11:19.410
Suguru?

11:20.740 --> 11:22.110
Fools.

11:22.110 --> 11:26.050
No matter how many of you join, you cannot protect Sibyl.

11:26.050 --> 11:28.070
What are you doing? Stop it!

11:33.320 --> 11:34.950
Ms. Fiona?

11:43.230 --> 11:44.370
Ms. Fiona!

11:44.370 --> 11:45.870
It's dangerous-

11:44.900 --> 11:47.200
Drei, what kind of joke is this?

11:47.840 --> 11:50.700
Do you intend to disobey Monado Aria?

11:51.110 --> 11:53.670
Vier, I'm not disobeying.

11:53.670 --> 11:56.470
I haven't set foot outside the mansion.

12:01.080 --> 12:03.350
So he appeared through an illusion.

12:11.190 --> 12:12.680
Y-You're...

12:15.230 --> 12:17.460
Yes. Sorry.

12:18.200 --> 12:20.530
You and I are enemies.

12:27.740 --> 12:29.680
Ashum Fiona.

12:29.680 --> 12:32.880
It means "white lie" in German.

12:34.050 --> 12:36.110
Ohmi, you knew all along?

12:36.950 --> 12:38.790
I wasn't certain.

12:38.790 --> 12:41.090
But she did catch my attention,

12:41.090 --> 12:42.680
and I was investigating her.

12:43.990 --> 12:45.990
The time of her transfer aligned with

12:45.990 --> 12:48.960
the falling of the barrier around the town,

12:48.960 --> 12:50.860
so I was wary.

12:52.770 --> 12:56.770
The magician who attacked us said he wanted Tamaki to disappear

12:56.770 --> 12:59.800
because that little girl was wavering. Right?

13:00.270 --> 13:01.440
Yes.

13:01.440 --> 13:03.210
Do you think that's true?

13:05.080 --> 13:06.280
I don't know.

13:06.280 --> 13:08.820
But according to the Bureau of Medicine,

13:08.820 --> 13:11.380
the Logos' internal strife is increasing.

13:12.250 --> 13:15.620
In any case, we should increase our vigilance,

13:15.620 --> 13:17.790
and protect Tamaki.

13:19.560 --> 13:21.000
I'm sorry.

13:21.000 --> 13:24.430
I need to hurry up and become a proper Tamayori princess.

13:24.430 --> 13:25.470
It's all right.

13:25.470 --> 13:29.270
As long as you think so, there's a way.

13:31.810 --> 13:33.000
Yes.

13:34.610 --> 13:38.440
Inukai, have you found the Logos hideout?

13:38.850 --> 13:41.210
Not yet.

13:41.750 --> 13:43.980
I have to find it soon.

13:54.600 --> 13:56.690
All that and nothing.

13:59.470 --> 14:01.090
But I'm not done yet!

14:03.800 --> 14:04.740
Huh?

14:05.470 --> 14:07.630
This is new.

14:10.440 --> 14:13.280
Ceremonial... offering...

14:14.110 --> 14:15.280
...records?

14:22.060 --> 14:23.490
The blood of the Tamayori,

14:23.490 --> 14:24.990
however faded,

14:24.990 --> 14:26.890
is the pathos of man's world.

14:26.890 --> 14:28.830
The one in whose blood the spirit resides

14:28.830 --> 14:32.230
is the one to seal the Onikirimaru.

14:36.040 --> 14:38.630
The seal of the Onikirimaru weakens.

14:39.170 --> 14:43.010
Through one person, joy returns to the world.

14:43.010 --> 14:45.980
Thus the blood seal was strengthened.

14:46.910 --> 14:49.920
The seal of the Onikirimaru weakens.

14:49.920 --> 14:51.440
Through one person...

14:52.390 --> 14:55.480
Lots of different people wrote the same thing...

14:58.890 --> 15:00.230
There are so many.

15:05.370 --> 15:07.340
The conflict of the seal?

15:07.900 --> 15:10.600
In the past, the Logos have attacked many times.

15:10.600 --> 15:13.970
These guardians and the previous guardians repelled them.

15:15.740 --> 15:19.750
This is the same thing that Mahiro said.

15:19.750 --> 15:21.740
Could there be more?

15:24.390 --> 15:25.720
This is-

15:25.950 --> 15:28.090
By the Tamayori's awakening,

15:28.090 --> 15:30.580
the guardians gain their original powers.

15:32.630 --> 15:34.060
Which means...

15:34.060 --> 15:35.200
That's right!

15:35.200 --> 15:38.100
If I become a proper Tamayori princess,

15:38.100 --> 15:41.070
everyone will become stronger, and we can fight off the Logos.

15:42.640 --> 15:45.470
Could this be what Grandma...

15:47.640 --> 15:50.040
In any case, I have to tell everyone.

16:03.590 --> 16:05.090
Oh, it's you.

16:05.090 --> 16:06.220
Ashiya...

16:06.790 --> 16:08.600
Have you been well?

16:08.600 --> 16:10.060
Ah, yes.

16:10.060 --> 16:13.030
I'm in a hurry, so excuse me.

16:14.270 --> 16:15.760
You're being used.

16:16.140 --> 16:17.630
Have you ever considered that?

16:21.740 --> 16:27.410
Or considered it strange that your predecessor never told you anything?

16:28.980 --> 16:31.320
I've always thought so.

16:31.320 --> 16:33.590
But I've realized it.

16:33.590 --> 16:37.350
My grandmother was silent so I'd discover it myself.

16:39.460 --> 16:40.790
So that's what you think.

16:41.300 --> 16:44.870
But you still don't know what you need to do...

16:44.870 --> 16:46.870
to become a real Tamayori princess.

16:46.870 --> 16:49.460
I thought I'd tell you.

16:59.280 --> 17:02.380
I will not allow you to take another step closer to her.

17:02.380 --> 17:03.980
Takuma.

17:04.450 --> 17:07.320
Why do you approach Tamaki?

17:07.320 --> 17:08.760
My, my.

17:08.760 --> 17:11.430
It seemed like there was such a large divide among your group,

17:11.430 --> 17:13.160
I didn't think you'd come.

17:13.490 --> 17:16.760
It looks like you've made stronger bonds than I'd thought.

17:18.170 --> 17:20.900
Answer me.
Depending on your response...

17:20.900 --> 17:22.340
As an ally,

17:22.340 --> 17:24.670
I was just going to give some advice.

17:26.370 --> 17:29.830
Really? I'd love to hear it.

17:30.680 --> 17:32.210
Mahiro.

17:32.210 --> 17:33.880
Hey, Tamaki.

17:33.880 --> 17:37.680
I look away for a second, and you get yourself in trouble again.

17:39.490 --> 17:43.390
I don't believe that what you're trying to protect...

17:43.390 --> 17:45.030
is necessarily founded on justice.

17:45.030 --> 17:46.160
What do you mean?

17:45.760 --> 17:50.030
You may have already realized it, Tamaki.

17:54.370 --> 17:57.170
Have they started moving again?

17:58.070 --> 17:59.070
The seal?

17:59.070 --> 17:59.910
Let's go!

17:59.910 --> 18:00.970
Wait!

18:06.210 --> 18:08.220
Takuma, Mahiro!

18:08.220 --> 18:10.740
Please, there's something
I have to tell you.

18:12.090 --> 18:13.620
At a time like this? What?

18:13.620 --> 18:14.920
What's wrong?

18:15.620 --> 18:17.620
Even if you meet one of the Logos,

18:17.620 --> 18:19.430
I don't want you to fight them.

18:19.430 --> 18:20.930
Saying stuff like that again-

18:20.930 --> 18:22.100
This is different!

18:22.100 --> 18:27.300
I researched and found out that if I mature and awaken properly,

18:27.300 --> 18:29.740
you, the guardians, will become stronger!

18:32.270 --> 18:35.240
So I don't want you to do anything reckless.

18:37.380 --> 18:38.570
I'm sorry.

18:38.980 --> 18:42.080
Because I haven't awakened as the Tamayori princess,

18:42.080 --> 18:43.910
I've made you all suffer.

18:44.950 --> 18:47.580
And I said those high and mighty things to you...

18:50.320 --> 18:51.530
Idiot.

18:51.530 --> 18:52.790
Right back at you.

18:56.430 --> 18:58.920
Don't make me say any more.

19:02.440 --> 19:03.970
Hurry it up, idiot.

19:03.970 --> 19:05.030
Yes!

19:14.750 --> 19:15.950
Them!

19:15.950 --> 19:17.350
What's happening?

19:17.350 --> 19:18.580
It's the mountain god.

19:19.020 --> 19:21.780
The ruler of the gods in this region is fighting.

19:22.160 --> 19:25.250
He normally avoids involvement, no matter what happens.

19:29.100 --> 19:30.200
Tamaki.

19:30.200 --> 19:31.670
This is...

19:43.310 --> 19:44.570
Takuma!

19:56.590 --> 19:57.850
What's wrong, Takuma?

20:01.700 --> 20:03.390
I-It's nothing.

20:04.830 --> 20:06.090
Demon.

20:07.430 --> 20:10.200
Hungry... hungry...

20:08.440 --> 20:10.200
Stay back, Zwei.

20:10.870 --> 20:12.870
Don't take too long.

20:12.870 --> 20:14.880
Apparition of this distant region,

20:14.880 --> 20:17.140
take my blows and disappear!

20:29.890 --> 20:31.290
Did he get him?

20:31.890 --> 20:36.260
The mountain god, with all that power...

20:37.300 --> 20:38.990
So easily...

20:52.750 --> 20:53.910
I'm all right.

21:15.740 --> 21:16.740
Damn it!

21:16.740 --> 21:17.640
No!

21:19.110 --> 21:20.730
Hold back for now.

21:23.010 --> 21:24.170
Okay.

21:24.710 --> 21:27.880
We'll get stronger.
We won't lose next time.

21:35.820 --> 21:37.920
We definitely won't lose.

23:20.860 --> 23:23.560
So you were poisoned by the Artifact.

23:24.600 --> 23:25.960
Call them...

23:26.700 --> 23:28.100
here.

23:29.140 --> 23:30.230
Yes.

23:38.250 --> 23:40.410
Don't say anything.

23:40.410 --> 23:44.350
Just follow me.

23:45.890 --> 23:50.980
Do that, and I'll make you happy.

23:56.100 --> 24:01.030
Next Time: The Guardian's Feelings
